#. tsig keys management dialog help 1/4
#: library/cwm/src/modules/CWMTsigKeys.rb:557
msgid ""
"<p><big><b>TSIG Key Management</b></big><br>\n"
"Use this dialog to manage the TSIG keys.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><big><b>ການຈັດການຄີ TSIG</b></big><br>\n"
"ໃຊ້ໜ້າຕ່າງນີ້ເພື່ອຈັດການຄີ TSIG.</p>\n"

#. tsig keys management dialog help 2/4
#: library/cwm/src/modules/CWMTsigKeys.rb:561
msgid ""
"<p><big><b>Adding an Existing TSIG Key</b></big><br>\n"
"To add an already created TSIG key, select a <b>Filename</b> of the file\n"
"containing the key and click <b>Add</b>.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><big><b>ການເພີ່ມຄີ TSIG ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ</b></big><br>\n"
"ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຄີ TSIG ທີ່ສ້າງໄວ້ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ <b>ຊື່ໄຟລ໌</b> ຂອງໄຟລ໌\n"
"ທີ່ມີຄີຢູ່ ແລ້ວຄລິກ <b>ເພີ່ມ</b>.</p>\n"

#. tsig keys management dialog help 3/4
#: library/cwm/src/modules/CWMTsigKeys.rb:567
msgid ""
"<p><big><b>Creating a New TSIG Key</b></big><br>\n"
"To create a new TSIG key, set the <b>Filename</b> of the file in which to\n"
"create the key and the <b>Key ID</b> to identify the key then click\n"
"<b>Generate</b>.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><big><b>ການສ້າງຄີ TSIG ໃໝ່</b></big><br>\n"
"ເພື່ອສ້າງຄີ TSIG ໃໝ່, ໃຫ້ກຳນົດ <b>ຊື່ໄຟລ໌</b> ຂອງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຈະ\n"
"ໃຊ້ສ້າງຄີ ແລະ <b>ID ຂອງຄີ</b> ເພື່ອລະບຸຕົວຕົນຂອງຄີ ແລ້ວຄລິກ\n"
"<b>ສ້າງ (Generate)</b>.</p>\n"

#. tsig keys management dialog help 4/4
#: library/cwm/src/modules/CWMTsigKeys.rb:574
msgid ""
"<p><big><b>Removing a TSIG Key</b></big><br>\n"
"To remove a configured TSIG key, select it and click <b>Delete</b>.\n"
"All keys in the same file are deleted.\n"
"If a TSIG key is in use in the configuration\n"
"of the server, it cannot be deleted. The server must stop using it\n"
"in the configuration first.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><big><b>ການລຶບຄີ TSIG</b></big><br>\n"
"ເພື່ອລຶບຄີ TSIG ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້, ໃຫ້ເລືອກມັນແລ້ວຄລິກ <b>ລຶບ</b>.\n"
"ຄີທັງໝົດໃນໄຟລ໌ດຽວກັນຈະຖືກລຶບອອກ.\n"
"ຖ້າຄີ TSIG ກຳລັງຖືກໃຊ້ງານໃນການກຳນົດຄ່າ\n"
"ຂອງເຊີບເວີ, ມັນຈະບໍ່ສາມາດລຶບໄດ້. ເຊີບເວີຕ້ອງຢຸດການໃຊ້ງານມັນ\n"
"ໃນການກຳນົດຄ່າກ່ອນ.</p>\n"

#. Frame label - adding a created server key
