#. Heading for NCurses Control Center
#: library/desktop/src/clients/menu.rb:231
msgid "YaST Control Center"
msgstr "ສູນຄວບຄຸມ YaST"

#: library/desktop/src/clients/menu.rb:269
msgid "Run"
msgstr "ລັນ"

#. show popup when running as non-root
#: library/desktop/src/clients/menu.rb:280
msgid ""
"YaST2 Control Center is not running as root.\n"
"You can only see modules that do not require root privileges."
msgstr ""
"ສູນຄວບຄຸມ YaST2 ບໍ່ໄດ້ລັນໃນຖານະ root.\n"
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດເຫັນໄດ້ສະເພາະໂມດູນທີ່ບໍ່ຕ້ອງການສິດ root ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. NCurses (textmode) Control Center headline
#: library/desktop/src/clients/menu.rb:331
msgid "Controlling YaST ncurses with the Keyboard"
msgstr "ການຄວບຄຸມ YaST ncurses ດ້ວຍຄີບອດ"

#. NCurses Control Center help 1/
#: library/desktop/src/clients/menu.rb:334
msgid ""
"<p>1) <i>General</i><br>\n"
"Navigate through the dialog elements with [TAB] to go to\n"
"the next element and [SHIFT] (or [ALT]) + [TAB] to move backwards.\n"
"Select or activate elements with [SPACE] or [ENTER].\n"
"Some elements use arrow keys (e.g., to scroll in lists).</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>1) <i>ທົ່ວໄປ</i><br>\n"
"ໄປຕາມອົງປະກອບຕ່າງໆໃນໜ້າຕ່າງດ້ວຍ [TAB] ເພື່ອໄປຍັງ\n"
"ອົງປະກອບຖັດໄປ ແລະ [SHIFT] (ຫຼື [ALT]) + [TAB] ເພື່ອຍ້າຍກັບຄືນ.\n"
"ເລືອກ ຫຼື ເປີດໃຊ້ງານອົງປະກອບດ້ວຍ [SPACE] ຫຼື [ENTER].\n"
"ບາງອົງປະກອບໃຊ້ປຸ່ມລູກສອນ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເພື່ອເລື່ອນເບິ່ງໃນລາຍການ).</p>"

#. NCurses Control Center help 2/10
#: library/desktop/src/clients/menu.rb:342
msgid ""
"<p>Tree navigation is also done by arrow keys. To open or close a branch use "
"[SPACE]. For modules showing a tree (might look like a list) of "
"configuration items on the left side use [ENTER] to get corresponding dialog "
"on the right.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ການເລື່ອນເບິ່ງແບບຕົ້ນໄມ້ (tree) ກໍໃຊ້ປຸ່ມລູກສອນເຊັ່ນກັນ. ເພື່ອເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດກິ່ງງ່າໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [SPACE]. ສຳລັ"
"ບໂມດູນທີ່ສະແດງລາຍການການກຳນົດຄ່າແບບຕົ້ນໄມ້ (ອາດເບິ່ງຄືລາຍການ) ຢູ່ດ້ານຊ້າຍ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [ENTER] ເພື່ອສະ"
"ແດງໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຢູ່ດ້ານຂວາ.</p>"

#. NCurses Control Center help 3/10
#: library/desktop/src/clients/menu.rb:349
msgid ""
"<p>Buttons are equipped with shortcut keys (the highlighted\n"
"letter). Use [ALT] and the letter to activate the button.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ປຸ່ມຕ່າງໆມີປຸ່ມລັດ (ຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ເນັ້ນ). ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [ALT] ແລະ ຕົວອັກສອນນັ້ນເພື່ອໃຊ້ງານປຸ່ມ.</p>"

#. NCurses Control Center help 4/10
#: library/desktop/src/clients/menu.rb:353
msgid ""
"<p>Press [ESC] to close selection pop-ups (e.g., from\n"
"menu buttons) without choosing anything.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>ກົດ [ESC] ເພື່ອປິດປັອບອັບການເລືອກ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຈາກ\n"
"ປຸ່ມເມນູ) ໂດຍບໍ່ໄດ້ເລືອກຫຍັງ.</p>\n"

#. NCurses Control Center help 5/10
#: library/desktop/src/clients/menu.rb:357
msgid ""
"<p>2) <i>Substitution of Keystrokes</i><br>\n"
"<p>Because the environment can affect the use of the keyboard,\n"
"there is more than one way to navigate the dialog pages.\n"
"If [TAB] and [SHIFT] (or [ALT]) + [TAB] do not work,\n"
"move focus forward with [CTRL] + [F] and backward with [CTRL] + [B].</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>2) <i>ການໃຊ້ປຸ່ມແທນ</i><br>\n"
"<p>ເນື່ອງຈາກສະພາບແວດລ້ອມອາດມີຜົນຕໍ່ການໃຊ້ຄີບອດ,\n"
"ຈຶ່ງມີຫຼາຍວິທີໃນການເລື່ອນເບິ່ງໜ້າຕ່າງ.\n"
"ຖ້າ [TAB] ແລະ [SHIFT] (ຫຼື [ALT]) + [TAB] ໃຊ້ງານບໍ່ໄດ້,\n"
"ໃຫ້ຍ້າຍໄປຂ້າງໜ້າດ້ວຍ [CTRL] + [F] ແລະ ຍ້າຍກັບຄືນດ້ວຍ [CTRL] + [B].</p>"

#. NCurses Control Center help 6/10
#: library/desktop/src/clients/menu.rb:365
msgid ""
"<p>If [ALT] + [letter] does not work,\n"
"try [ESC] + [letter]. Example: [ESC] + [H] for [ALT] + [H].\n"
"[ESC] + [TAB] is also a substitute for [ALT] + [TAB].</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ຖ້າ [ALT] + [ຕົວອັກສອນ] ໃຊ້ງານບໍ່ໄດ້,\n"
"ໃຫ້ລອງ [ESC] + [ຕົວອັກສອນ]. ຕົວຢ່າງ: [ESC] + [H] ແທນ [ALT] + [H].\n"
"[ESC] + [TAB] ກໍເປັນປຸ່ມແທນສຳລັບ [ALT] + [TAB].</p>"

#. NCurses Control Center help 7/10
#: library/desktop/src/clients/menu.rb:371
msgid ""
"<p>3) <i>Function Keys</i><br>\n"
"F keys provide a quick access to main functions. The function key bindings "
"for the current dialog are shown in the bottom line.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>3) <i>ປຸ່ມຟັງຊັນ (F keys)</i><br>\n"
"ປຸ່ມ F ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງຟັງຊັນຫຼັກໄດ້ໄວຂຶ້ນ. ການກຳນົດປຸ່ມຟັງຊັນສຳລັບໜ້າຕ່າງປັດຈຸບັນຈະສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນຢູ່ແຖວລຸ່ມສຸ"
"ດ.</p>"

#. NCurses Control Center help 8/10
#: library/desktop/src/clients/menu.rb:378
msgid "<p>The F keys are usually connected to a certain action:</p>"
msgstr "\" \"<p>ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປປຸ່ມ F ຈະເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບການກະທຳໃດໜຶ່ງ:</p>"

#. NCurses Control Center help 9/10
#: library/desktop/src/clients/menu.rb:380
msgid ""
"F1  = Help<br>\n"
"F2  = Info or Description<br>\n"
"F3  = Add<br>\n"
"F4  = Edit or Configure<br>\n"
"F5  = Delete<br>\n"
"F6  = Test<br>\n"
"F7  = Expert or Advanced<br>\n"
"F8  = Back<br>\n"
"F9  = Abort or Cancel<br>\n"
"F10 = OK, Next, Finish, or Accept<br>"
msgstr ""
"F1  = ຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ<br>\n"
"F2  = ຂໍ້ມູນ ຫຼື ຄຳອະທິບາຍ<br>\n"
"F3  = ເເພີ່ມ<br>\n"
"F4  = ແກ້ໄຂ ຫຼື ກຳນົດຄ່າ<br>\n"
"F5  = ລຶບ<br>\n"
"F6  = ທົດສອບ<br>\n"
"F7  = ສຳລັບຜູ້ຊ່ຽວຊານ ຫຼື ຂັ້ນສູງ<br>\n"
"F8  = ກັບຄືນ<br>\n"
"F9  = ຍົກເລີກ<br>\n"
"F10 = ຕົກລົງ, ຖັດໄປ, ສິ້ນສຸດ, ຫຼື ຍອມຮັບ<br>"

#. NCurses Control Center help 10/10
#: library/desktop/src/clients/menu.rb:393
msgid ""
"<p>In some environments, all or some\n"
"F keys are not available.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ໃນບາງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ,\n"
"ປຸ່ມ F ທັງໝົດ ຫຼື ບາງປຸ່ມອາດໃຊ້ງານບໍ່ໄດ້.</p>"

