msgid ""
"Ignoring a package failure may result in a broken system.\n"
"The system should be later verified by running the Software Management "
"module."
msgstr ""
"ການລະເລີຍຄວາມຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວຂອງແພັກເກດອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ລະບົບເສຍຫາຍ.\n"
