#. error report
#: library/packages/src/modules/PackageCallbacks.rb:661
msgid ""
"<p>The repository at the specified URL now provides a different media ID.\n"
"If the URL is correct, this indicates that the repository content has "
"changed. To \n"
"continue using this repository, start <b>Installation Repositories</b> "
"from \n"
"the YaST control center and refresh the repository.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>ຄັງຊອບແວ (repository) ຢູ່ URL ທີ່ລະບຸຕອນນີ້ໃຫ້ Media ID ທີ່ຕ່າງໄປ.\n"
"ຖ້າ URL ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ນີ້ສະແດງວ່າເນື້ອຫາໃນຄັງຊອບແວມີການປ່ຽນແປງ. ເພື່ອ \n"
"ໃຊ້ງານຄັງຊອບແວນີ້ຕໍ່ໄປ, ໃຫ້ເປີດ <b>ຄັງຊອບແວສຳລັບຕິດຕັ້ງ</b> ຈາກ \n"
"ສູນຄວບຄຸມ YaST ແລ້ວກົດຣີເຟຣຊຄັງຊອບແວ.</p>\n"

