#: library/packages/src/modules/PackageLock.rb:60
msgid ""
"PackageKit is blocking software management.\n"
"This happens when the updater applet or another software management\n"
"application is running.\n"
"\n"
"Ask PackageKit to quit?"
msgstr ""
"PackageKit ກຳລັງປິດກັ້ນການຈັດການຊອບແວ.\n"
"ເຫດການນີ້ເກີດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອຕົວອັບເດດ ຫຼື ໂປຣແກຣມຈັດການຊອບແວອື່ນ\n"
"ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່.\n"
"\n"
"ຕ້ອງການສັ່ງໃຫ້ PackageKit ປິດບໍ?"

