"\n"
"The file has been changed, either by accident or by an attacker,\n"
"since the repository creator signed it. Using it is a big risk\n"
"for the integrity and security of your system.\n"
"\n"
"Use it anyway?\n"
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ %1 ຈາກຄັງເກັບ %2\n"
"%3\n"
"ຖືກລົງລາຍເຊັນດ້ວຍກຸນແຈ GnuPG ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້, ແຕ່ການກວດສອບຄວາມສົມບູນລົ້ມເຫຼວ: %4\n"
"\n"
"ໄຟລ໌ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງ, ອາດຈະດ້ວຍຄວາມບັງເອີນ ຫຼື ຖືກໂຈມຕີ,\n"
"ນັບຕັ້ງແຕ່ຜູ້ສ້າງຄັງເກັບໄດ້ລົງລາຍເຊັນໄວ້. ການໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ນີ້ຈະມີຄວາມສ່ຽງສູງ\n"
"ຕໍ່ຄວາມປອດໄພ ແລະ ຄວາມສົມບູນຂອງລະບົບ.\n"
"\n"
"ຍັງຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ຕໍ່ໄປຫຼືບໍ່?\n"

#. popup heading
#: library/packages/src/modules/SignatureCheckDialogs.rb:452
msgid "Validation Check Failed"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງລົ້ມເຫຼວ"

#. popup question, %1 stands for the package name, %2 for the complex multiline description of the GnuPG key
#: library/packages/src/modules/SignatureCheckDialogs.rb:479
#, ycp-format
msgid ""
"The package %1 is digitally signed\n"
"with the following unknown GnuPG key: %2.\n"
"\n"
"This means that a trust relationship to the creator of the package\n"
"cannot be established. Installing the package may put the integrity\n"
"of your system at risk.\n"
"\n"
"Install it anyway?"
msgstr ""
"ແພັກເກດ %1 ຖືກລົງລາຍເຊັນດີຈີຕອນ\n"
"ດ້ວຍກຸນແຈ GnuPG ທີ່ບໍ່ຮູ້ຈັກຕໍ່ໄປນີ້: %2.\n"
"\n"
"ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ ບໍ່ສາມາດຢືນຢັນຄວາມໜ້າເຊື່ອຖືຂອງຜູ້ສ້າງແພັກເກດໄດ້.\n"
"ການຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດນີ້ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງລະບົບທ່ານມີຄວາມສ່ຽງ.\n"
"\n"
"ຍັງຕ້ອງການຕິດຕັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປຫຼືບໍ່?"

#. popup question, %1 stands for the filename, %2 for the complex multiline description of the GnuPG key
#: library/packages/src/modules/SignatureCheckDialogs.rb:492
#, ycp-format
msgid ""
"The file %1\n"
"is digitally signed with the following unknown GnuPG key: %2.\n"
"\n"
"This means that a trust relationship to the creator of the file\n"
"cannot be established. Using the file may put the integrity\n"
"of your system at risk.\n"
"\n"
"Use it anyway?"
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ %1\n"
"ຖືກລົງລາຍເຊັນດີຈີຕອນດ້ວຍກຸນແຈ GnuPG ທີ່ບໍ່ຮູ້ຈັກຕໍ່ໄປນີ້: %2.\n"
"\n"
"ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ ບໍ່ສາມາດຢືນຢັນຄວາມໜ້າເຊື່ອຖືຂອງຜູ້ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ໄດ້.\n"
"ການໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ນີ້ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງລະບົບທ່ານມີຄວາມສ່ຽງ.\n"
"\n"
"ຍັງຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ຕໍ່ໄປຫຼືບໍ່?"

#. Part of the GnuPG key description in popup, %1 is a GnuPG key ID
#. Part of the GnuPG key description in popup, %1 is a GnuPG key ID
#: library/packages/src/modules/SignatureCheckDialogs.rb:512
#: library/packages/src/modules/SignatureCheckDialogs.rb:1004
#, ycp-format
msgid "ID: %1"
msgstr "ໄອດີ: %1"

#. popup heading
#: library/packages/src/modules/SignatureCheckDialogs.rb:520
msgid "Unknown GnuPG Key"
msgstr "ບໍ່ຮູ້ຈັກກຸນແຈ GnuPG"

#. popup question, %1 stands for the package name, %2 for the key ID, %3 for the key name
#: library/packages/src/modules/SignatureCheckDialogs.rb:568
#, ycp-format
msgid ""
"The package %1 is digitally signed\n"
"with key '%2 (%3)'.\n"
"\n"
"There is no trust relationship with the owner of the key.\n"
"If you trust the owner, mark the key as trusted.\n"
"\n"
"Installing a package from an unknown repository puts\n"
"the integrity of your system at risk. It is safest\n"
"to skip the package.\n"
msgstr ""
"ແພັກເກດ %1 ຖືກລົງລາຍເຊັນດີຈີຕອນ\n"
"ດ້ວຍກຸນແຈ '%2 (%3)'.\n"
"\n"
"ບໍ່ມີຄວາມໜ້າເຊື່ອຖືໃດໆ ກັບເຈົ້າຂອງກຸນແຈນີ້.\n"
"ຫາກທ່ານເຊື່ອຖືເຈົ້າຂອງ, ໃຫ້ໝາຍກຸນແຈນີ້ວ່າ ເຊື່ອຖືໄດ້.\n"
"\n"
"ການຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດຈາກຄັງເກັບທີ່ບໍ່ຮູ້ຈັກ ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ລະບົບມີຄວາມສ່ຽງ.\n"
"ທາງທີ່ປອດໄພທີ່ສຸດແມ່ນໃຫ້ ຂ້າມ ແພັກເກດນີ້ໄປ.\n"

#. popup question, %1 stands for the filename, %2 for the key ID, %3 for the key name
#: library/packages/src/modules/SignatureCheckDialogs.rb:582
#, ycp-format
msgid ""
"The file %1 is digitally signed\n"
"with key '%2 (%3)'.\n"
"\n"
"There is no trust relationship with the owner of the key.\n"
"If you trust the owner, mark the key as trusted.\n"
"\n"
"Installing a file from an unknown repository puts\n"
"the integrity of your system at risk. It is safest\n"
"to skip it.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ %1 ຖືກລົງລາຍເຊັນດີຈີຕອນ\n"
"ດ້ວຍກຸນແຈ '%2 (%3)'.\n"
"\n"
"ບໍ່ມີຄວາມໜ້າເຊື່ອຖືໃດໆ ກັບເຈົ້າຂອງກຸນແຈນີ້.\n"
"ຫາກທ່ານເຊື່ອຖືເຈົ້າຂອງ, ໃຫ້ໝາຍກຸນແຈນີ້ວ່າ ເຊື່ອຖືໄດ້.\n"
"\n"
"ການຕິດຕັ້ງໄຟລ໌ຈາກຄັງເກັບທີ່ບໍ່ຮູ້ຈັກ ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ລະບົບມີຄວາມສ່ຽງ.\n"
"ທາງທີ່ປອດໄພທີ່ສຸດແມ່ນໃຫ້ ຂ້າມ ມັນໄປ.\n"

#. popup heading
#: library/packages/src/modules/SignatureCheckDialogs.rb:603
msgid "Signed with Untrusted Public Key"
msgstr "ລົງລາຍເຊັນດ້ວຍກຸນແຈສາທາລະນະທີ່ບໍ່ໜ້າເຊື່ອຖື"

#. push button
#: library/packages/src/modules/SignatureCheckDialogs.rb:610
msgid "&Trust and Import the Key"
msgstr "&ເຊື່ອຖື ແລະ ນຳເຂົ້າກຸນແຈ"

#. additional Richtext (HTML) warning text (kind of help), 1/2
#: library/packages/src/modules/SignatureCheckDialogs.rb:643
msgid ""
"<p>The owner of the key may distribute updates,\n"
"packages, and package repositories that your system will trust and offer\n"
"for installation and update without any further warning. In this way,\n"
"importing the key into your keyring of trusted keys allows the key owner\n"
"to have a certain amount of control over the software on your system.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ເຈົ້າຂອງກຸນແຈອາດຈະແຈກຢາຍການອັບເດດ, ແພັກເກດ ແລະ ຄັງເກັບແພັກເກດ\n"
"ທີ່ລະບົບຂອງທ່ານຈະເຊື່ອຖື ແລະ ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ ຫຼື ອັບເດດໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ມີການເຕືອນອີກ.\n"
"ດ້ວຍວິທີນີ້, ການນຳເຂົ້າກຸນແຈເຂົ້າໃນພວງກຸນແຈທີ່ເຊື່ອຖືໄດ້ ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເຈົ້າຂອງກຸນແຈ\n"
"ສາມາດຄວບຄຸມຊອບແວໃນລະບົບຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ໃນລະດັບໃດໜຶ່ງ.</p>"

#. additional Richtext (HTML) warning text (kind of help), 2/2
#: library/packages/src/modules/SignatureCheckDialogs.rb:651
msgid ""
"<p>A warning dialog opens for every package that\n"
"is not signed by a trusted (imported) key. If you do not trust the key,\n"
"the packages or repositories created by the owner of the key will not be "
"used.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ໜ້າຕ່າງເຕືອນຈະສະແດງຂຶ້ນສຳລັບທຸກແພັກເກດ\n"
"ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ລົງລາຍເຊັນໂດຍກຸນແຈທີ່ເຊື່ອຖື (ທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າແລ້ວ). ຫາກທ່ານບໍ່ເຊື່ອຖື\n"
"ກຸນແຈນີ້, ແພັກເກດ ຫຼື ຄັງເກັບທີ່ສ້າງໂດຍເຈົ້າຂອງກຸນແຈຈະບໍ່ຖືກນຳໃຊ້.</p>"

#. popup message - label, part 1, %1 stands for repository name, %2 for its URL
#: library/packages/src/modules/SignatureCheckDialogs.rb:661
#, ycp-format
msgid ""
"The following GnuPG key has been found in repository\n"
"%1\n"
"(%2):"
msgstr ""
"ພົບກຸນແຈ GnuPG ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃນຄັງເກັບ\n"
"%1\n"
"(%2):"

#. popup message - label, part 2
#: library/packages/src/modules/SignatureCheckDialogs.rb:671
msgid ""
"You can choose to import it into your keyring of trusted\n"
"public keys, meaning that you trust the owner of the key.\n"
"You should be sure that you can trust the owner and that\n"
"the key really belongs to that owner before importing it."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກນຳເຂົ້າກຸນແຈນີ້ເຂົ້າໃນພວງກຸນແຈສາທາລະນະທີ່ເຊື່ອຖືໄດ້,\n"
"ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າທ່ານເຊື່ອຖືເຈົ້າຂອງກຸນແຈ.\n"
"ທ່ານຄວນແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານເຊື່ອຖືເຈົ້າຂອງ ແລະ ກຸນແຈນີ້ເປັນຂອງເຈົ້າຂອງຄົນນັ້ນແທ້\n"
"ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະທຳການນຳເຂົ້າ."

#. warning label - the key to import is expired
#: library/packages/src/modules/SignatureCheckDialogs.rb:683
msgid "WARNING: The key has expired!"
msgstr "ຄຳເຕືອນ: ກຸນແຈນີ້ໝົດອາຍຸແລ້ວ!"

#. popup heading
#: library/packages/src/modules/SignatureCheckDialogs.rb:709
msgid "Import Untrusted GnuPG Key"
msgstr "ນຳເຂົ້າກຸນແຈ GnuPG ທີ່ບໍ່ໜ້າເຊື່ອຖື"

#. push button
#: library/packages/src/modules/SignatureCheckDialogs.rb:723
msgid "&Trust"
msgstr "&ເຊື່ອຖື"

#. popup question, %1 stands for the filename, %2 is expected checksum
#. %3 is the current checksum (e.g. "803a8ff00d00c9075a1bd223a480bcf92d2481c1")
#: library/packages/src/modules/SignatureCheckDialogs.rb:756
#, ycp-format
msgid ""
"The expected checksum of file %1\n"
"is %2,\n"
"but the current checksum is %3.\n"
"\n"
"The file has been changed by accident or by an attacker\n"
"since the repository creator signed it. Using it is a big risk\n"
"for the integrity and security of your system.\n"
"\n"
"Use it anyway?\n"
msgstr ""
"ລະຫັດກວດສອບ (checksum) ທີ່ຄາດໄວ້ຂອງໄຟລ໌ %1\n"
"ແມ່ນ %2,\n"
"ແຕ່ລະຫັດກວດສອບຕົວຈິງແມ່ນ %3.\n"
"\n"
"ໄຟລ໌ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງໂດຍບັງເອີນ ຫຼື ຖືກໂຈມຕີ ນັບຕັ້ງແຕ່ຜູ້ສ້າງຄັງເກັບ\n"
"ໄດ້ລົງລາຍເຊັນໄວ້. ການໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ນີ້ມີຄວາມສ່ຽງສູງຕໍ່ຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງລະບົບ.\n"
"\n"
"ຍັງຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ຕໍ່ໄປຫຼືບໍ່?\n"

#. dialog heading - displayed in a big bold font
#: library/packages/src/modules/SignatureCheckDialogs.rb:773
msgid "Wrong Digest"
msgstr "ລະຫັດກວດສອບ (Digest) ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ"

#. popup question, %1 stands for the filename, %2 is expected digest, %3 is the current digest
#: library/packages/src/modules/SignatureCheckDialogs.rb:793
#, ycp-format
msgid ""
"The checksum of file %1\n"
"is %2,\n"
"but the expected checksum is not known.\n"
"\n"
"This means that the origin and integrity of the file\n"
"cannot be verified. Using the file puts the integrity of your system at "
"risk.\n"
"\n"
"Use it anyway?\n"
msgstr ""
"ລະຫັດກວດສອບຂອງໄຟລ໌ %1\n"
"ແມ່ນ %2,\n"
"ແຕ່ບໍ່ຮູ້ລະຫັດກວດສອບທີ່ຄາດໄວ້.\n"
"\n"
"ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ ແຫຼ່ງທີ່ມາ ແລະ ຄວາມສົມບູນຂອງໄຟລ໌ບໍ່ສາມາດກວດສອບໄດ້.\n"
"ການໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ນີ້ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງລະບົບທ່ານມີຄວາມສ່ຽງ.\n"
"\n"
"ຍັງຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ຕໍ່ໄປຫຼືບໍ່?\n"

#. dialog heading - displayed in a big bold font
#: library/packages/src/modules/SignatureCheckDialogs.rb:807
msgid "Unknown Digest"
msgstr "ບໍ່ຮູ້ຈັກລະຫັດກວດສອບ (Digest)"

